---
---

<section class="coaches" id="entrenadores">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="badge">Nuestro Equipo</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">CONOCE A LOS <span>ENTRENADORES</span></h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Profesionales certificados con experiencia en ligas nacionales e internacionales, apasionados por el desarrollo humano y deportivo.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="coaches-grid">
      <div class="coach-card featured">
        <div class="coach-img-wrap">
          <img src="/psb-photo-15.jpg" alt="Head Coach · Director Técnico PSB" class="coach-img" />
          <div class="coach-overlay"></div>
          <div class="coach-badge">Head Coach</div>
        </div>
        <div class="coach-info">
          <h3>Director Técnico</h3>
          <span class="coach-title">PSB · Pro Skills Basketball Colombia</span>
          <p>Fundador y director de la academia. Con más de 15 años de experiencia formando atletas a nivel nacional. Certificado FIBA, apasionado por el desarrollo integral del deportista.</p>
          <div class="coach-tags">
            <span class="tag">Fundador</span>
            <span class="tag">FIBA Certificado</span>
            <span class="tag">15+ años</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="coach-card">
        <div class="coach-img-wrap">
          <img src="/psb-photo-20.jpg" alt="Entrenador Élite PSB" class="coach-img" />
          <div class="coach-overlay"></div>
          <div class="coach-badge">Prog. Élite</div>
        </div>
        <div class="coach-info">
          <h3>Categoría Élite</h3>
          <span class="coach-title">Entrenador · Alto Rendimiento</span>
          <p>Especialista en desarrollo técnico-táctico para jugadores en etapa de alto rendimiento. Trabaja con atletas que buscan proyección universitaria y semiprofesional.</p>
          <div class="coach-tags">
            <span class="tag">Alto Rendimiento</span>
            <span class="tag">Táctica</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="coach-card">
        <div class="coach-img-wrap">
          <img src="/psb-photo-30.jpg" alt="Entrenador Juvenil PSB" class="coach-img" />
          <div class="coach-overlay"></div>
          <div class="coach-badge">Cat. Juvenil</div>
        </div>
        <div class="coach-info">
          <h3>Categoría Juvenil</h3>
          <span class="coach-title">Entrenador · Formación Deportiva</span>
          <p>Dedicado a la formación técnica y preparación física en categorías 11-17 años. Sus equipos han obtenido múltiples podios en torneos departamentales y nacionales.</p>
          <div class="coach-tags">
            <span class="tag">Formación</span>
            <span class="tag">Competencias</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .coaches {
    background: var(--black);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .coaches::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -80px;
    right: -80px;
    width: 350px;
    height: 350px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,215,0,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .coaches::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -60px;
    left: -60px;
    width: 250px;
    height: 250px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,102,204,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto 60px;
  }

  .section-desc {
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-top: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .coaches-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .coach-card {
    background: var(--black-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--black-border);
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .coach-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,215,0,0.1);
  }

  .coach-card.featured {
    border-color: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.35);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .coach-img-wrap {
    position: relative;
    height: 320px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .coach-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top center;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.5s ease;
  }

  .coach-card:hover .coach-img { transform: scale(1.06); }

  .coach-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 100%);
  }

  .coach-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--proskills-black);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    padding: 5px 14px;
    border-radius: 100px;
  }

  .coach-info { padding: 22px; }

  .coach-info h3 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--proskills-black);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .coach-title {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--proskills-black);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .coach-info p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .coach-tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .tag {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: rgba(255,215,0,0.2);
    color: var(--proskills-black);
    padding: 4px 11px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,215,0,0.2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .coaches-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
